# Sprint board

Everything still open, as a query rather than a list somebody maintains.

```hql#eval
cards
| filter(c => c.metadata.status == "todo")
| sort(by = c => c.title)
| map(c => c.title)
| table
```

```hql#result
value
---------------
Bearer tokens
Session cookies
```

## Closest to bearer tokens

```hql#query
cards
| semantic("bearer token authorization")
| take(2)
| table
```

```hql#result
rank  score   card           title
----  ------  -------------  -------------
1     0.4534  bearer-tokens  Bearer tokens
2     0.4198  oauth          OAuth 2.0
```
